    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0090_913fc78cce07.png\" style=\"width: 560px; height: 100px;\" /></p>It is&nbsp;oxymercuration&ndash;demercuration reaction. In this an alkene is treated with mercury(II) acetate,&nbsp;and the product is treated with sodium borohydride. The net result is a Markovnikov addition product without rearrangement."
